306	     * Reads the {@code Idempotency-Key} header of the request currently being handled, used to make
307	     * owner creation idempotent. Returns the trimmed key when present and non-blank, otherwise
308	     * {@code null} (including when there is no active servlet request), so a missing or blank key
309	     * simply means "no idempotency" and the create proceeds normally.
310	     *
