519	     * The number of owners that may be created on a single business day before a bulk-signup
520	     * warning is raised. Once more than this many owners already fall on the current business
521	     * day, {@code bulkSignupWarning} is reported as {@code true} in the owner response.
522	     */
523	    private static final int BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD = 80;
