525	    /**
526	     * Reports whether an unusually high number of owners have been created for today's business
527	     * day, i.e. whether more than {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already fall on
528	     * the business day that {@code LocalDate.now()} rolls forward to.
